            <title>Loupe 1.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 19:45:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>New</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Loupe can now update itself. Choose <b>Check for Updates…</b> from the menu bar icon or by right-clicking the toolbar. Loupe also asks once whether to check for updates automatically.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Fixed</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Highlights now appear when another app has an invisible window over your screen, such as a screen recorder, screen dimmer or annotation tool.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
